+---
+id: task-004-rent-equipment-by-the-hour
+type: task
+title: "Rent equipment by the hour"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Rent equipment by the hour
+
+`addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (integer euro cents for one hour). A rental shorter than
+a day that starts and ends on the hour is priced at `hourlyPrice` for each hour.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- `hourlyPrice`, when given, must be a non-negative safe integer.
+- A period under 24 hours with start and end on the hour costs hours x `hourlyPrice` (no discount).
+- An item without `hourlyPrice` cannot be quoted or booked by the hour; `availability` for an hourly
+  period lists only items with an hourly price.
+- Periods of a day or more still need UTC midnights; off-the-hour times are rejected.
+- Hourly bookings conflict only when their periods overlap.
